cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you implement or cite these specifications, please cite them as below.
  For a specific version, cite the GitHub Release (and its Zenodo DOI) you used.
title: "Principal Handoff (agent-ops-specs)"
abstract: >-
  Open, implementation-neutral specifications for operating AI agents alongside
  the person or organisation they act for. Principal Handoff covers work and
  choices that only the principal may settle and that outlive every agent
  session, with owned registers, claims, and settlements that record who
  decided and under what authority.
type: software
authors:
